In the result, we pass the following:
ORDER (1) Appeals are allowed in part;
(2) The judgment and award dated 16th August, 2019 passed in MVC No.1884 of 2016 and 1885 of 2016 by the Senior Civil Judge and Additional Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Athani is modified by enhancing the compensation as above;

